{
  "id": "DEU.31",
  "number": "31",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 31",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa gawa hoorgeeda Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa: Musa fuga Israeli ng'asheesu seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha saawa, “Aniini ghamneawa geabeayi gweanyeew bughala ea diktam, mudu daamu daweelweel. Ak ea niyeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Mwajaghaawana eeni bea Yordaniin.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghoaghaaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gawa madeadaang'u, ak gayghwanung' goosha eemoojisu aba madeadaang'u, ak gajambala ak gaygawa Yoshuwa madeadaang'u gawuurji gidanyaashta NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwahinda NG'UTAMIIDA saawa gidahinda Sihoni ea Ogu was sugoodiga fuga Amori, ea ng'eanyiida nyaawa damanda nung' goosha saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA saawa madeadaang'u ak gijoari, ak gajasimana ng'asheega sean rugu diigheanda ghayi earukuneey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaruusiita nea goobea gurooruunatka meanyi, adaghang'udeagwa giyoonda nea adoawali saawa; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U niny dea iideayeewi gil, mayghoashoanyaneey nea maygwanung'seey heeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa Musa Yoshuwa ak gwayeesha aba madeeda fuga Israeli sean, “Daruusiida nea gibea guroorooda mwaayi aba gideaba gajadeayeewana fiisu jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi aksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda ghweaniga nyaawa gideaba gayghoadaw saawa, ak gayhearasiina saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA niny gaygoosheedeaweey ak gajandeayeena, mayghoashoanyaneey nea maygwanung'seey heeda, adibeali nea adihirbabani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa gajeasoamwa deaweeda gweaydeaba ispwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'oar Musa deaweedeeni, ak ghoadaw ashoohoodiga was orjooga fuga Lawi, sar sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA ea gweargwa sean bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa Musa saawa nea gwayeesha, “Gilinyoo ea muudeanooda gweaydeaba ispwa, bea damanda gweayda fuufta, bea damanda ghweelmeeda meandoojiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibuwa fuga Israeli sean madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, bea heeda loat, abeeda giisoami deaweedeeni aba madeeda fuga Israeli sean ghwayiiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwadana geat buuneeda was headiga ea gadeemga, ea diibiga, ea rabascheanda mida mujiinajeagaagu, ak ghwayiiy nea ghwanal nea ghoawal NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak ging'ulayi muuchi sinooda ng'asheega sean bea deaweedean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak diibiga nyaawa mwanala ghwayiiy ak ghwanal, nea ghoawal NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, aba damanda sean jea oopiidana ng'eanyiida jea ookghaawana Yordani ak goombali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega huuydean bea NG'UTAMIIDA aba heeda Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Ng'ula, eawoojigaagu jea meawana nineekiit, guursiina Yoshuwa, ak gooweayi jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak gaydaadaw niny iita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabussa NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda maheemajeanda aba daraneeda shamooghooda, ak ghamiinaada daraneedida bea shamooghoodean aba ghuuta maheemajeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Ng'ula, eawoojigaagu jea meawana nineekiit, ak fiisu gayghang'eat ghwaat geeshta hiseadayeanduumeeda aseecheeka rabasta mida ng'eanyiida, ak ghoabita bugusta nyaawa, ak gaygwanung'usean heeda ak gaygwanyarja neajeedeanyu ghayi easinyi sea saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweecheanji gaydanyareas aba badahuuka nyaawa, ak gaydanung'wa heeda, ak gaydafuy gheamamdeanyu aba heanyaawa ak gajeayaak nea ghwanyas ng'asheega munyas saang'a ak gajeeyi, hean eaweecheanji gajeeyi, ‘Ng'asheesu munyasiin geanyaschi aba gideaba ASEETA manda jeedeanya?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydafuy gheamamdeanyu aba huumwa eaweecheanji aba ng'asheega munyas sean sisin aba gideaba gwayamsa geat aseecheeka suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'oara duumi ak giinaali fuga Israeli, ak giyiini jeeda ghuusiga nyaawa, ak gayghoah duumi muushoocheanda aba heedeanyu aba badayda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas ghaahiiti ng'eanyiida gulda eanooga ea maleeda, ghayi eayeaksi habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw ghweaniga nyaawa, ak geeyeagiischi ea eelang'u nea geeriisha, ak gwayamsa geat aseecheeka suuk, nea gagadiiyeesa saawa, ak gafoolan nea gwanyarja neajeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas ghwanyas ng'asheega munyas saang'a ea deawiitmeeda, aba badahuuka nyaawa, abeeda duumi gayghoahaawda saawa gawuurji muushoocheanda (aba gideaba aba giibinda nyaawa adagwaroosa aba ghuusiga jeacheenga nyaawa), aba gideaba geabean danal giiteemshooda nyaawa gidateemsheesa damanda mii daahiitaawa jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi eayeaksi habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'oar Musa duumi eaweedida ak ghoanaal fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Yoshuwa was orjeeda Nuni nea gwayeesha, “Daruusiida, nea guwoosi mwaayi, aba gideaba gajaada diibiga Israeli jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi eayeaksi habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw saawa. Ak gaydagoonyi eara ang'iing'i.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoahiit Musa ng'oorda ng'asheegeaba deaweedeeni aba jeeda gitaabu, ea ghwahita muudeanooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwarukusa Musa fuga Lawi sar sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oang'waanya gitaaboani bea deaweedean, ak ghoayiinyi murdeeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak goobiida hoowa gawuurji muushoocheanda aba badaydaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghaanali heeheeweagaagu ea hang'ooynata uhuudaang'u, ng'ula, gutajaamjaam sea agooga, ghamneawa, ak goondeawi heeheeweega aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda gaygawuurjiin inyas ghami! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwadana geat gweargwa sean bea eemeedeang'wa ea fugeagwa hees aba gideaba gaydarukusa ng'asheesu ghwayiiy nea gamuuwu humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida aba badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaanali gideaba inyas ghaameayi; gajoopita jeeda ng'asheega munyas nea ghoapuuchi naweeda ghayi earukuneegwa, ak aba huuydeanda gajanyasa sawanaduutka, aba gideaba goosinyi ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoang'udi niny nyarasta aba gadiyeeda geatingeagwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
